@program gtk3-text-input-test
@compositor gnome
@conf hime-edit-display=2
@conf hime-on-the-spot-key=1
# As wl-im-preedit.keys, through GNOME's IBus (hime-ibus):
# With the preedit in the application (on the spot, keys included), it
# shows the keys typed so far.
b 1 a @check <space> b c @check <bs> @check <space>
